*E_NAME		"Clever Newter"

*E_CHAT		"I have researched and studied for the prosperity of Pillai all my life. I just can't leave this town even after having been injured like this."
*E_CHAT		"I keep thinking about what I can do to get Pillai back."
*E_CHAT		"Please use the Teleport Core when you go to battle, it is the crystal I have studied. "
*E_CHAT		"Brave warrior. Please take our Pillai back. "